      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;waking-up-scott-kiloby&#34;&gt;Waking Up Scott Kiloby&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/wakingup_kiloby.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Scott Kiloby&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1419695789/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/quiet_rev_l.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/quiet_rev_l.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The following is an extract from the above book, &lt;em&gt;Love&amp;rsquo;s Quiet Revolution: the End of the Spiritual Search&lt;/em&gt;. Purchase from &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/1419695789/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;US&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.co.uk/exec/obidos/ASIN/1419695789/thespiritupat-21&#34;&gt;UK&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Visit Scott&amp;rsquo;s website - &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.kiloby.com/&#34;&gt;Reflections of the One Life&lt;/a&gt;, where other essays may be read and videos watched on-line.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;See Scott&amp;rsquo;s entry on the &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/resources/western.htm#kiloby&#34;&gt;Western Writers&lt;/a&gt; page.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Notice that life is a symphony of sights, sounds, smells, sensations, thoughts, feelings, states, and experiences. Notice that the beautiful music of this symphony can only be fully realized when there is no self pretending to be the conductor.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
